@startuml  
title Use Case 2.2: My Rehomes Management
actor User
participant MyRehomes.vue
participant animals.ts
participant animals.py
participant animal_service.py
database MySQL

User -> MyRehomes.vue: Visit /my-rehomes
MyRehomes.vue -> animals.ts: listAnimals(owner_id)
animals.ts -> animals.py: GET /animals?owner_id=X
animals.py -> animal_service.py: list_animals()
animal_service.py -> MySQL: SELECT animals WHERE owner_id
MySQL --> animal_service.py: animals[]
animal_service.py --> animals.py: result
animals.py --> animals.ts: 200 OK
animals.ts --> MyRehomes.vue: animals
MyRehomes.vue --> User: Display list
@enduml